---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout currentPage="consulting">
  <div class="consulting-content">
    <p>
      I'm a founding engineer building production AI agent systems — tool execution, retrieval
      pipelines, evals, and streaming at scale. Before that, I was a staff engineer at Stripe
      building the API layer that powers SDKs, docs, and the dashboard across the entire product.
      MIT EECS.
    </p>
    <p>
      I've shipped agentic systems that run in production and know where the common failure modes
      are. I take a small number of engagements on the side.
    </p>

    <h2>AI implementation audit</h2>
    <p>
      You're building with LLMs or agents and want a real expert to pressure-test it before you
      commit. I'll review your architecture, tooling choices, retrieval setup, and eval coverage —
      and deliver a written assessment with concrete recommendations.
    </p>
    <p>This is for teams that want to move fast and not find out later they built on the wrong foundation.</p>

    <h2>Agent prototype</h2>
    <p>
      A working agent for a specific workflow — not a demo, something that actually runs. I'll
      scope it, build it, and hand it off with documentation.
    </p>
    <p>If you're not sure what's possible or you've tried and hit walls, this is the fastest way to find out.</p>

    <h2>Advisory</h2>
    <p>
      Lightweight ongoing advisory for early-stage startups. Monthly calls, async feedback, honest
      technical direction from someone who has shipped agent platforms and API infrastructure at scale.
    </p>
    <p>Equity only. Not taking cash advisory work at this time.</p>

    <p class="cta">
      <a href="mailto:consulting@kyeb.com">Get in touch</a> for availability and pricing.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .consulting-content {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .consulting-content p {
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .consulting-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .consulting-content a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--link);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--link-underline);
  }

  .consulting-content a:hover {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--link);
  }

  .cta {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
